  "no_auto_dialogue_generation": true,
  "notes": "CineAgent 現有 run_pipeline.py 未實作 TTS、對嘴、背景音訊混音或 MP4 串接；本檔是製作時碼契約，需外部配音工具與剪輯工具處理。音訊以全片絕對秒數標記；台語口音不是必需。",
  "cues": [
    {
      "cue_id": "S01-A1",
      "scene_id": 0,
      "speaker": "NARRATOR",
      "text": "那場雨，我先看見了他的傷。",
      "start_second": 1,
      "end_second": 5.9,
      "voice_profile": "YU_CHENG_VO",
      "require_lipsync": false
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S02-A1",
      "scene_id": 1,
      "speaker": "YUCHENG",
      "text": "還會痛嗎？",
      "start_second": 7.7,
      "end_second": 9.4,
      "voice_profile": "YUCHENG",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S02-A2",
      "scene_id": 1,
      "speaker": "YUYU",
      "text": "會啊，只是習慣了。",
      "start_second": 10.1,
      "end_second": 12.5,
      "voice_profile": "YUYU",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S03-A1",
      "scene_id": 2,
      "speaker": "YUYU",
      "text": "你看起來，也很累。",
      "start_second": 14.8,
      "end_second": 17.2,
      "voice_profile": "YUYU",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S03-A2",
      "scene_id": 2,
      "speaker": "NARRATOR",
      "text": "原來他也看見了我。",
      "start_second": 17.7,
      "end_second": 20.4,
      "voice_profile": "YU_CHENG_VO",
      "require_lipsync": false
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S04-A1",
      "scene_id": 3,
      "speaker": "NARRATOR",
      "text": "從那天起，我開始期待明天。",
      "start_second": 22,
      "end_second": 27,
      "voice_profile": "YU_CHENG_VO",
      "require_lipsync": false
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S05-A1",
      "scene_id": 4,
      "speaker": "YUCHENG",
      "text": "晚餐留給你了。",
      "start_second": 28.8,
      "end_second": 31,
      "voice_profile": "YUCHENG",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S05-A2",
      "scene_id": 4,
      "speaker": "YUYU",
      "text": "你怎麼每次都等我。",
      "start_second": 31.4,
      "end_second": 33.9,
      "voice_profile": "YUYU",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-A1",
      "scene_id": 5,
      "speaker": "YUYU",
      "text": "育呈，你也需要被照顧啊。",
      "start_second": 35.7,
      "end_second": 38.7,
      "voice_profile": "YUYU",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-A2",
      "scene_id": 5,
      "speaker": "NARRATOR",
      "text": "我一直記得。",
      "start_second": 39.1,
      "end_second": 41.3,
      "voice_profile": "YU_CHENG_VO",
      "require_lipsync": false
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S07-A1",
      "scene_id": 6,
      "speaker": "YUYU",
      "text": "我考過了。",
      "start_second": 42.7,
      "end_second": 45.4,
      "voice_profile": "YUYU",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S07-A2",
      "scene_id": 6,
      "speaker": "NARRATOR",
      "text": "可是那天，我沒有趕到。",
      "start_second": 45.7,
      "end_second": 48.4,
      "voice_profile": "YU_CHENG_VO",
      "require_lipsync": false
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S08-A1",
      "scene_id": 7,
      "speaker": "YUYU",
      "text": "我想要你在，不是事後補償。",
      "start_second": 49.6,
      "end_second": 52.7,
      "voice_profile": "YUYU",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S08-A2",
      "scene_id": 7,
      "speaker": "YUCHENG",
      "text": "對不起。",
      "start_second": 53,
      "end_second": 55.1,
      "voice_profile": "YUCHENG",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S09-A1",
      "scene_id": 8,
      "speaker": "YUYU",
      "text": "我也想去看看，自己能走多遠。",
      "start_second": 56.7,
      "end_second": 62,
      "voice_profile": "YUYU",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S10-A1",
      "scene_id": 9,
      "speaker": "YUCHENG",
      "text": "你早就決定了，卻沒有告訴我。",
      "start_second": 63.8,
      "end_second": 68.9,
      "voice_profile": "YUCHENG",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S11-A1",
      "scene_id": 10,
      "speaker": "YUYU",
      "text": "我也有我自己的人生。",
      "start_second": 70.4,
      "end_second": 73.2,
      "voice_profile": "YUYU",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S11-A2",
      "scene_id": 10,
      "speaker": "YUCHENG",
      "text": "我只是怕失去你。",
      "start_second": 73.5,
      "end_second": 76.4,
      "voice_profile": "YUCHENG",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S12-A1",
      "scene_id": 11,
      "speaker": "YUCHENG",
      "text": "我不該用付出，要求你留下。",
      "start_second": 77.5,
      "end_second": 80.7,
      "voice_profile": "YUCHENG",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S12-A2",
      "scene_id": 11,
      "speaker": "YUYU",
      "text": "我也不該一直逃避。",
      "start_second": 80.9,
      "end_second": 83.5,
      "voice_profile": "YUYU",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S13-A1",
      "scene_id": 12,
      "speaker": "YUCHENG",
      "text": "你一定會成為很棒的設計師。",
      "start_second": 84.8,
      "end_second": 89.9,
      "voice_profile": "YUCHENG",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S14-A1",
      "scene_id": 13,
      "speaker": "YUCHENG",
      "text": "去吧。不是不愛，是不再攔你。",
      "start_second": 91.5,
      "end_second": 95.8,
      "voice_profile": "YUCHENG",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S14-A2",
      "scene_id": 13,
      "speaker": "NARRATOR",
      "text": "那天我沒有追。",
      "start_second": 96,
      "end_second": 97.5,
      "voice_profile": "YU_CHENG_VO",
      "require_lipsync": false
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S15-A1",
      "scene_id": 14,
      "speaker": "NARRATOR",
      "text": "一年後，我又走進了有他的雨夜。",
      "start_second": 98.6,
      "end_second": 104.2,
      "voice_profile": "YU_CHENG_VO",
      "require_lipsync": false
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S16-A1",
      "scene_id": 15,
      "speaker": "YUYU",
      "text": "歡迎光……",
      "start_second": 106,
      "end_second": 107.9,
      "voice_profile": "YUYU",
      "require_lipsync": true
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S16-A2",
      "scene_id": 15,
      "speaker": "NARRATOR",
      "text": "如果重逢，我們還能相愛嗎？",
      "start_second": 108.8,
      "end_second": 111.7,
      "voice_profile": "YU_CHENG_VO",
      "require_lipsync": false
    }
  ],
